# Read by ical4j (as a custom alias file) after its own tables, so these win.
# The Windows names Outlook writes in TZID, where ical4j's table points to a zone whose rules are not the
# ones of the whole Windows zone: "Pacific Standard Time" is Canada/Pacific there, and British Columbia
# stopped changing the clocks in 2026, but the Windows zone is the one of Los Angeles.
Pacific\ Standard\ Time=America/Los_Angeles
Central\ Standard\ Time=America/Chicago
GMT\ Standard\ Time=Europe/London
